<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρυπν-έω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠγρύπνηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Prog.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			:—<i>lie awake, pass sleepless nights</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				471
			</span></i>, Hp.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				695a
			</span></i>, etc.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθεύδω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.3.42
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρυπνεῖν τὴν νύκτα</span>
			<i>to pass a sleepless</i> night, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.2.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				113
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ -οῦντες</span>
			<i>sufferers from insomnia</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.64
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., <i>to
				be watchful</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				6.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				13.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
				6.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὲρ τῶν ψυχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Heb.</u>
					13.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὰ κακά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Da.</u>
					9.14
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηθέν σε ἐνοχλήσειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGrenf.</u>
					2.14a3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c.acc., <i>lie
				awake and think of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.2966
				</span></i>
			.</div>
